sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Client as MCP Client
    participant Server as MCP Server
    participant Provider as Second IdP

    Client->>Server: tools/call
    Note over Server: no token for this user at the second IdP
    Server-->>Client: elicitation/create (mode: url)
    Client->>User: show URL, ask consent
    User-->>Client: consent
    Client->>Provider: open URL (browser)
    User->>Provider: sign in, authorize
    Provider-->>Server: redirect with code
    Note over Server: exchange code, bind token to user
    Client->>Server: tools/call (retry)
    Server->>Provider: call API with token
    Server-->>Client: result
